sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant J as PRP Jobs
    participant D as Lease / state DB
    participant W as Worker
    participant O as Observer / supervisor
    J->>W: Dispatch reserved attempt
    C->>J: Cancel or connection closes
    J->>D: Record cancel request / fence
    J->>W: Best-effort abort
    W-->>J: Unsupported / acknowledgement lost
    J->>D: Execution UNKNOWN; quarantine
    J-->>C: Outcome + uncertainty visible
    O->>W: Obtain termination evidence
    W-->>O: Verified finish / process stopped
    O->>D: Reconcile usage; release invocation
    Note over C,O: Late output cannot reopen terminal job or erased content. Database TTL does not prove GPU stopped
